# Device-class profile: 1st-gen Jetson Nano (JetPack 4, L4T R32) — weak CPU,
# no usable GPU inference path. Sourced by deploy/run-node.sh (see orin.env
# for how profiles work).
#
# Full resolution, like every node (max res is the project default). No pose —
# the skeleton model needs an Orin-class GPU (central-side inference is the
# documented fallback for this class). If THIS device's CPU can't hold the
# frame rate, opt in per-device via EXTRA_ARGS=--preview-stride 2 in
# /etc/default/kinect-node — it is not a class default.
PROFILE_EXTRA_ARGS=''
